OL,3,GNEWSATraders face nine-day market
OL,4,Aclosure after fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FKingston's Ancient Market will close
OL,7,Ffor nine days after further safety
OL,8,Fconcerns were identified during
OL,9,Finspections following a fire that
OL,10,Fdestroyed several stalls and damaged
OL,11,Fnearby businesses on Tuesday.
OL,13,FKingston Council said the whole market
OL,14,Fwould shut from 10 to 18 October while
OL,15,Fdamaged stalls are made safe,
OL,16,Fdemolition work is prepared and the
OL,17,Fsite is cleared.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
