OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATraders face nine-day market
OL,4,Aclosure after fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Andreas Kirsch said the
OL,7,Fdecision had not been taken lightly:
OL,8,F"We know it has a big impact on the
OL,9,Ftraders, not just the ones affected by
OL,10,Fthe fire but all the other traders."
OL,12,FInvestigators believe the blaze was
OL,13,Fcaused by an electrical fault in a
OL,14,Ffridge, although London Fire Brigade
OL,15,Fhas not said where it was located.
